sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SVC as DialogueService
    participant ENG as DialogueEngine
    participant PLAN as TurnPlanner
    participant TASK as TaskHandler
    participant FLOW as FlowExecutor
    participant DB as MySQL

    U->>API: 帮我查物流
    API->>SVC: Message(TEXT)
    SVC->>DB: load_state(sender_id)
    DB-->>SVC: DialogueState
    SVC->>ENG: process_message
    ENG->>PLAN: predict
    PLAN-->>ENG: start_flow(logistics_tracking)
    ENG->>TASK: handle(commands)
    TASK->>FLOW: run_task
    Note over TASK,FLOW: active_task 停在 ask_order_number<br/>创建 CollectSystemContext
    FLOW-->>TASK: 请告诉我订单号 + action_listen
    TASK-->>ENG: BotMessages
    ENG-->>SVC: 提交本轮 Turn
    SVC->>DB: save_state
    SVC-->>API: ProcessResult
    API-->>U: 请告诉我订单号

    U->>API: ORDER1001
    API->>SVC: 新的 Message(TEXT)
    SVC->>DB: load_state(sender_id)
    DB-->>SVC: 恢复原 step、slots、CollectSystemContext
    SVC->>ENG: process_message
    ENG->>PLAN: predict
    PLAN-->>ENG: set_slots(order_number=ORDER1001)
    ENG->>TASK: handle(commands)
    Note over TASK,FLOW: 填槽并结束 CollectSystemContext
    TASK->>FLOW: run_task
    Note over TASK,FLOW: 回到 active_task 的 collect Step<br/>发现槽位已有值，继续 lookup_logistics
    FLOW-->>TASK: 物流查询结果
    TASK-->>ENG: BotMessages
    ENG-->>SVC: 提交本轮 Turn
    SVC->>DB: save_state
    API-->>U: 返回物流公司、单号和进度
